[["heading","F ULL-STACK SOFTWARE ENGINEERING • INTERVIEW PREPARATION"],["heading","08"],["heading","JavaScript\nFundamentals"],["heading","Complete Visual Teaching Edition"],["sinhala","","JavaScript මූලික සංකල්ප එකින් එක ඉJගෙන ගෙනිමු.",357],["text","40 individual lessons • English + Sinhala • JavaScript code • graphical explanations"],["text","20 original topics\n5 earlier additions\n15 new additions"],["heading","How to study"],["text","Read the definition, inspect the graphic, predict the output, run the example, then answer the\ninterview question without reading the answer. Complete the exercise before moving on."],["sinhala","","මුලින් definition එක කියවන්න. Diagram එJකන් values Jවනස් වන ආකාරය බලන්න. Code",478],["sinhala","","output එක අනුමාන කර run කරන්න. අවසානJයේ interview answer එක තමන්Jගේ වචනවලින්",482],["sinhala","","කියන්න.",44],["heading","Scope"],["text","Core language concepts. Browser DOM, asynchronous APIs, promises, event loop and browser\nstorage are covered in Section 09. The examples are designed for a modern JavaScript\nruntime."],["text","Basis: Full_Stack_SE_Internship_Checklist.pdf, Section 08;\nSections_04-34_Full_Stack_Interview_Study_Guide.pdf, Section 08. Added topics are selected for interview\npreparation, not an exhaustive ECMAScript specification."]]